msgid ""
"This package is a dual-publish of the "
"[undici](https://www.npmjs.com/package/undici) library types. The "
"`undici` package **still contains types**. This package is for users who "
"_only_ need undici types (such as for `@types/node`). It is published "
"alongside every release of `undici`, so you can always use the same "
"version."
